=== truncate-via-symlink
--- file real.txt
1
2
3
--- symlink link.txt real.txt
--- script
history_truncate_file "link.txt" 1
file_stat "link.txt"
file_read "real.txt"

=== truncate-mode-of-result
--- file perm.txt mode=0644
1
2
3
--- script
