file_stat "perm.txt"

=== truncate-readonly-dir
--- dir ro
--- file ro/h.txt
1
2
3
--- script
chmod "ro" 0555
history_truncate_file "ro/h.txt" 1
chmod "ro" 0755
file_read "ro/h.txt"

=== variables-defaults
--- script
get history_write_timestamps
get history_multiline_entries
get history_file_version
get history_lines_read_from_file
get history_lines_written_to_file
